From 85f5f87916535e5d9e786a0a614335418cb8ac44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A6 FM bring-up <a6lte-fm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] a6lte: add RDS/AF decoding and FM capture policy

Implement bounded FIFO polling, confirmed PS/2A/2B text and PI identity,
G0-to-UTF-8 conversion, Method-A/B AF lists and stronger-same-PI probes.
Restore tune/mute after probes and expose the real FMRadio JNI contract.
Attach the existing SEC FM capture port in an A6-specific audio policy.
Include decoder/failure-injection/AF/socket tests and hardware caveats.

Requires the v2 Bluetooth broker and FMRadio follow-up patches.
Firmware, Android policy/build and physical audio remain unverified.
